  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Initial release. Users with direct and team-inherited security roles; effective per-table CRUD depth; per-user column security; and copy/assign of roles, column security profiles, team membership and business unit with a preview and a per-item log. WebView2-hosted Windows 95 UI; shared logic with the D365 web resource and the Power Platform ToolBox tool. Needs the System Administrator role.",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": false,
